{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a minimalist free-kick football game in which you truly control how you kick the ball by selecting:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of the kick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contact point on the ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The direction of impact</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those parameters decides the trajectory, and the animations are just scenery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the contact point is off-center, the ball spins and is affected by the Magnus force.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the ball spins horizontally, its trajectory curves left or right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the ball spins vertically, the Magnus force pushes it downward, causing the ball to dip faster (see &quot;David Luiz's freekick masterclass&quot; on Youtube)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Top-corner goals are rewarded with a higher score, and it will also be multiplied by the combo count, so don't miss and take risks with the top corner when you can.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game is a good choice to relax and chase your high score for half an hour every now and then. There are leaderboards for you to compete with your friends as well!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3047000?t=1771941215","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/f702bb4d2ed13953c9a313611cbc2995620e0a2b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771941215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/8fccf05cc3b7f7704c65343cb843cc6edd4dd777/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771941215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/8fccf05cc3b7f7704c65343cb843cc6edd4dd777/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771941215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4314070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a minimalist free-kick football game in which you truly control how you kick the ball by selecting:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The power of the kick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contact point on the ball</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The direction of impact</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those parameters decides the trajectory, and the animations are just scenery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >When the contact point is off-center, the ball spins and is affected by the Magnus force.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the ball spins horizontally, its trajectory curves left or right.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the ball spins vertically, the Magnus force pushes it downward, causing the ball to dip faster (see &quot;David Luiz's freekick masterclass&quot; on Youtube)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Top-corner goals are rewarded with a higher score, and it will also be multiplied by the combo count, so don't miss and take risks with the top corner when you can.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game is a good choice to relax and chase your high score for half an hour every now and then. There are leaderboards for you to compete with your friends as well!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TDSoftwareZ"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"ht